 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (7)': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points and Imperial Arrest Order; these count toward the 60. The eighth line, '?????? (depend)', is the poster's open slot for the third starting Effect (the strategy: 'The third starting effect is usualy YOU CANNOT HIDE FOREVER', which is already listed under Effects), so it is not a card row. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Endor Operation' dested Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost (the strategy calls it an 'endor operation deck'); Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Kessel and Sullust use the Dark printings.",
  "The section headers 'Kinky green' (weapons), 'Big blue' (starships and vehicles) and 'Inter red' (interrupts) are the poster's nicknames for card types, not cards.",
  "Posted 'Vader's stick' dested Vader's Lightsaber; 'Mara's stick' dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Mara Jade' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Janus' dested Janus Greejatus; 'Grand Admiral Trawn' dested Grand Admiral Thrawn; 'Admiral Ozel' dested Admiral Ozzel; 'Omnious rumous' dested Ominous Rumors; 'Overseeing it personaly' dested Overseeing It Personally; 'Twilek Advisor' dested Twi'lek Advisor; 'We're in attack position' dested We're In Attack Position Now.",
  "Oppressive Enforcement and Secret Plans are Special Edition Effects in 2001 (not Defensive Shields).",
  "The section counts as posted (7+16+2+5+10+9+9+2) total 60.",
  "The poster says he wants to try the deck at a local tournament and asks for reviews."
